      {
        "id": 231694,
        "name": "GeorgeDubya",
        "username": "GeorgeDubya",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/b487fb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-07-19T01:17:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1. I think it would be a good chance for a combination of Environment challenges/minions and a Domain villain.</p>\n<p>2. Twist wise, I would balance between challenges and adding minions that act as offshoots of the main nano-mass. Challenges could be hinders or full on challenges that act as barriers between the heroes (Walls of nano-particles spring up blocking different groups from each other, heroes without thematically appropriate powers can't effect one another until the walls are overcome).</p>\n<p>3. I like all of Powerhounds ideas here.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
